<title>GERMANY: Deutsche details 1996 risk provisions.</title>
<headline>Deutsche details 1996 risk provisions.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche gave the following</p>
<p>breakdown of its group risk provisions for 1996 (in millions of</p>
<p>marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Provisions formed to the debit of P&amp;L    3,552  vs 4,229</p>
<p>    Provisions released to the credit of P&amp;L 2,755  vs 2,882</p>
<p>    Total						 797   vs 1,347</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Deutsche Bank AG</p>
<p>. The breakdown was given in its annual report.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
